# Files in this repo that must never be symlinked into $HOME.
#
# Merged over dotfiler's built-in defaults (readme.*, .gitignore, changelog.*,
# and friends). Each line is a case-insensitive regex matched against the
# basename, anchored at both ends — not a glob, so '.' matches any character.
#
# Being ignored does not unlink anything that is already linked: the file still
# exists here, so nothing dangles and it simply drops out of the tree. Run
# `dot prune` after adding a pattern.

# Agent instructions belong to this repo, not to $HOME. A CLAUDE.md at the $HOME
# root is read as project instructions by any agent session started there, which
# would silently apply this repo's conventions to unrelated work.
AGENTS\.md
CLAUDE\.md

# macOS system file
\.DS_Store
